sequenceDiagram
 participant U as User
 participant FE as React
 participant API as Express
 participant DB as MongoDB
 participant AI as FastAPI
 participant S as Socket.IO
 U->>FE: Enter natural language goal
 FE->>API: POST /workflow/create
 API->>DB: Create workflow
 API->>AI: POST /agent/plan
 AI-->>API: Plan + tasks
 API->>DB: Save tasks
 API-->>FE: Workflow
 U->>FE: Execute
 FE->>API: POST /workflow/execute
 API->>AI: POST /agent/run
 AI-->>API: running / awaiting_approval / completed
 API->>DB: Persist state + logs
 API->>S: Emit realtime event
 S-->>FE: workflow-running / approval-created / completed
 U->>FE: Approve risky action
 FE->>API: POST /approval/approve
 API->>AI: POST /agent/run with approved task
 AI-->>API: Completed
 API->>DB: Persist final state
 API->>S: workflow-completed
 S-->>FE: Completion event
